{"id":"vd-b1-the-volunteer","level":"b1","n":56,"title":{"en":"I Didn't Realize","vi":"Em đã không nhận ra"},"summary":"Bên bữa tối ở nhà cô Rosa, Chloe tìm cách giải thích và xin lỗi vì những bức ảnh; hai người dần hiểu cách nghĩ của nhau.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-volunteer","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Volunteer","vi":"Tình nguyện viên"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"tea","x":800}]},"cast":{"rosa":{"name":{"en":"Rosa","vi":"Rosa"},"look":"woman","x":540,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#B98160","skinShade":"#A06A4A","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#B03A2E","topShade":"#942F25"}},"chloe":{"name":{"en":"Chloe","vi":"Chloe"},"look":"teengirl","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#D9B26F","outfit":"jacket","top":"#5DADE2","topShade":"#4A9CD1"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"rosa","en":"Sit down, Chloe. Have some tea. You look tired.","vi":"Ngồi đi, Chloe. Uống chút trà nhé. Trông em mệt quá.","ipa":["sɪt","daʊn","ˈkloʊi","hæv","sʌm","ti","ju","lʊk","ˈtaɪɚd"],"start":0.554,"end":5.664,"expression":"neutral","prop":"tea","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.805],[2,1.417],[3,2.864],[4,3.098],[5,3.333],[6,4.713],[7,4.947],[8,5.156]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Thank you. Rosa, I'm so sorry about the photos.","vi":"Em cảm ơn. Cô Rosa, em thật sự xin lỗi về chuyện những bức ảnh.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","ˈɹoʊzə","aɪm","soʊ","ˈsɑɹi","əˈbaʊt","ðə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz"],"start":6.454,"end":10.974,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,6.454],[1,6.708],[2,7.934],[3,8.78],[4,9.014],[5,9.353],[6,9.848],[7,10.16],[8,10.264]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"I know. The parents were very upset.","vi":"Cô biết. Các phụ huynh rất bực.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","ðə","ˈpɛɹənts","wɝ","ˈvɛɹi","əpˈsɛt"],"start":11.764,"end":14.884,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,11.764],[1,11.819],[2,13.228],[3,13.384],[4,13.827],[5,13.97],[6,14.282]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"I didn't realize it was a problem. I didn't mean to upset anyone.","vi":"Em đã không nhận ra đó là vấn đề. Em không cố ý làm ai phật lòng.","ipa":["aɪ","ˈdɪdənt","ˈɹiəˌlaɪz","ɪt","wɑz","ə","ˈpɹɑbləm","aɪ","ˈdɪdənt","min","tu","əpˈsɛt","ˈɛniˌwʌn"],"start":15.674,"end":20.854,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,15.674],[1,15.762],[2,16.166],[3,16.778],[4,16.908],[5,17.09],[6,17.182],[7,18.733],[8,18.889],[9,19.241],[10,19.566],[11,19.723],[12,20.27]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"I believe you. But you didn't ask for permission.","vi":"Cô tin em. Nhưng em đã không xin phép.","ipa":["aɪ","bɪˈliv","ju","bʌt","ju","ˈdɪdənt","æsk","fɔɹ","pɚˈmɪʃən"],"start":21.644,"end":24.994,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,21.644],[1,21.725],[2,22.064],[3,23.329],[4,23.511],[5,23.629],[6,23.902],[7,24.162],[8,24.306]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Where I come from, people share photos all the time. Nobody thinks about it.","vi":"Ở chỗ em, người ta chia sẻ ảnh suốt. Chẳng ai nghĩ ngợi gì cả.","ipa":["wɛɹ","aɪ","kʌm","fɹʌm","ˈpipəl","ʃɛɹ","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz","ɔl","ðə","taɪm","ˈnoʊˌbɑˌdi","θɪŋks","əˈbaʊt","ɪt"],"start":25.784,"end":31.634,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,25.784],[1,25.98],[2,26.123],[3,26.461],[4,27.112],[5,27.516],[6,27.855],[7,28.454],[8,28.701],[9,28.831],[10,30.213],[11,30.773],[12,31.138],[13,31.502]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"Here it's different. Many tourists have taken photos of our children like souvenirs.","vi":"Ở đây thì khác. Nhiều khách du lịch đã chụp ảnh bọn trẻ như thể chúng là đồ lưu niệm.","ipa":["hiɹ","ɪts","ˈdɪfɚənt","ˈmɛni","ˈtʊɹəsts","hæv","ˈteɪkən","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz","ʌv","ˈaʊɚ","ˈtʃɪldɹən","laɪk","ˌsuvəˈnɪɹz"],"start":32.424,"end":37.694,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,32.424],[1,32.563],[2,32.746],[3,34.245],[4,34.571],[5,35.092],[6,35.235],[7,35.599],[8,36.068],[9,36.146],[10,36.276],[11,36.719],[12,36.928]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"That's horrible. I should have asked first.","vi":"Thật kinh khủng. Lẽ ra em phải hỏi trước.","ipa":["ðæts","ˈhɔɹəbəl","aɪ","ʃʊd","hæv","æskt","fɝst"],"start":38.484,"end":42.034,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,38.484],[1,38.738],[2,40.406],[3,40.589],[4,40.849],[5,41.018],[6,41.448]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"In our culture, trust takes time. People want to know you before they share their families.","vi":"Trong văn hoá của chúng tôi, lòng tin cần thời gian. Người ta muốn hiểu em trước khi mở lòng về gia đình họ.","ipa":["ɪn","ˈaʊɚ","ˈkʌltʃɚ","tɹʌst","teɪks","taɪm","ˈpipəl","wɑnt","tu","noʊ","ju","bɪˈfɔɹ","ðeɪ","ʃɛɹ","ðɛɹ","ˈfæməliz"],"start":42.824,"end":48.444,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,42.824],[1,42.905],[2,43.049],[3,43.739],[4,44.064],[5,44.351],[6,45.72],[7,46.059],[8,46.254],[9,46.358],[10,46.579],[11,46.814],[12,47.191],[13,47.309],[14,47.569],[15,47.738]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"I understand. I've already deleted the photos.","vi":"Em hiểu rồi. Em đã xoá hết ảnh rồi ạ.","ipa":["aɪ","ˌʌndɚˈstænd","aɪv","ɔlˈɹɛdi","dɪˈlitəd","ðə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz"],"start":49.234,"end":53.364,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,49.234],[1,49.4],[2,51.225],[3,51.473],[4,51.981],[5,52.541],[6,52.645]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"Good. Tomorrow, you can apologize to the parents. I'll translate for you.","vi":"Tốt. Mai em có thể xin lỗi các phụ huynh. Cô sẽ dịch cho em.","ipa":["ɡʊd","təˈmɑˌɹoʊ","ju","kæn","əˈpɑləˌdʒaɪz","tu","ðə","ˈpɛɹənts","aɪl","tɹænzˈleɪt","fɔɹ","ju"],"start":54.154,"end":60.214,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,54.154],[1,55.435],[2,56.23],[3,56.334],[4,56.49],[5,57.193],[6,57.297],[7,57.402],[8,58.951],[9,59.146],[10,59.706],[11,59.902]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Thank you. I came here with so much enthusiasm, and now I feel terrible. I hope they can forgive me.","vi":"Em cảm ơn cô. Em đến đây với biết bao nhiệt huyết, vậy mà giờ em thấy tệ quá. Em mong họ có thể tha thứ cho em.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","aɪ","keɪm","hiɹ","wɪð","soʊ","mʌtʃ","ɪnˈθuziˌæzəm","ənd","naʊ","aɪ","fil","ˈtɛɹəbəl","aɪ","hoʊp","ðeɪ","kæn","fɚˈɡɪv","mi"],"start":61.004,"end":69.644,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,61.004],[1,61.258],[2,62.484],[3,62.679],[4,63.005],[5,63.343],[6,63.551],[7,63.864],[8,64.163],[9,65.478],[10,65.648],[11,65.96],[12,66.103],[13,66.429],[14,68.018],[15,68.187],[16,68.538],[17,68.695],[18,68.916],[19,69.372]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"They will, if you're patient. Can I tell you something else?","vi":"Họ sẽ tha thứ, nếu em kiên nhẫn. Cô nói thêm một điều được không?","ipa":["ðeɪ","wɪl","ɪf","jʊɹ","ˈpeɪʃənt","kæn","aɪ","tɛl","ju","ˈsʌmθɪŋ","ɛls"],"start":70.434,"end":74.364,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,70.434],[1,70.544],[2,71.143],[3,71.261],[4,71.404],[5,72.968],[6,73.151],[7,73.229],[8,73.476],[9,73.606],[10,73.984]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Of course. Please.","vi":"Tất nhiên ạ. Cô cứ nói.","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","pliz"],"start":75.154,"end":77.434,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,75.154],[1,75.346],[2,76.833]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"You came with many plans. But you never asked what we need.","vi":"Em đến với rất nhiều kế hoạch. Nhưng em chưa bao giờ hỏi chúng tôi cần gì.","ipa":["ju","keɪm","wɪð","ˈmɛni","plænz","bʌt","ju","ˈnɛvɚ","æskt","wʌt","wi","nid"],"start":78.224,"end":82.284,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,78.224],[1,78.334],[2,78.569],[3,78.725],[4,79.011],[5,80.615],[6,80.797],[7,80.928],[8,81.266],[9,81.631],[10,81.761],[11,81.891]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"You're right. I didn't realize that either. So… what do you need?","vi":"Cô nói đúng. Em cũng không nhận ra điều đó. Vậy… cô cần gì ạ?","ipa":["jʊɹ","ɹaɪt","aɪ","ˈdɪdənt","ˈɹiəˌlaɪz","ðæt","ˈiðɚ","soʊ","wʌt","du","ju","nid"],"start":83.074,"end":88.924,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,83.074],[1,83.295],[2,84.612],[3,84.768],[4,85.172],[5,85.771],[6,86.031],[7,87.385],[8,88.127],[9,88.349],[10,88.466],[11,88.609]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"Someone to help the older children with their reading. Quietly, every day.","vi":"Một người giúp những đứa lớn đọc sách. Lặng lẽ, ngày nào cũng vậy.","ipa":["ˈsʌmˌwʌn","tu","hɛlp","ðə","ˈoʊldɚ","ˈtʃɪldɹən","wɪð","ðɛɹ","ˈɹidɪŋ","ˈkwaɪətli","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ"],"start":89.714,"end":94.584,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,89.714],[1,90.056],[2,90.147],[3,90.381],[4,90.511],[5,90.824],[6,91.28],[7,91.41],[8,91.592],[9,92.988],[10,93.873],[11,94.159]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Then that's what I'll do. Starting tomorrow. And no more posters, I promise.","vi":"Vậy em sẽ làm việc đó. Bắt đầu từ ngày mai. Và không áp phích nữa, em hứa.","ipa":["ðɛn","ðæts","wʌt","aɪl","du","ˈstɑɹtɪŋ","təˈmɑˌɹoʊ","ənd","noʊ","mɔɹ","ˈpoʊstɚz","aɪ","ˈpɹɑməs"],"start":95.374,"end":102.544,"expression":"happy","react":{"rosa":"happy"},"timing":[[0,95.374],[1,95.618],[2,95.956],[3,96.151],[4,96.36],[5,97.625],[6,98.237],[7,99.812],[8,100.06],[9,100.307],[10,100.607],[11,101.661],[12,101.792]]}],"words":[{"id":"realize","en":"realize","ipa":"ˈɹiəˌlaɪz","vi":"nhận ra; hiểu ra; thực hiện","level":1},{"id":"mean","en":"mean","ipa":"min","vi":"có nghĩa là; ý là; keo kiệt","level":0},{"id":"permission","en":"permission","ipa":"pɚˈmɪʃən","vi":"sự cho phép; giấy phép","level":1},{"id":"culture","en":"culture","ipa":"ˈkʌltʃɚ","vi":"văn hóa; nền văn hóa","level":0},{"id":"apologize","en":"apologize","ipa":"əˈpɑləˌdʒaɪz","vi":"xin lỗi","level":1},{"id":"upset","en":"upset","ipa":"əpˈsɛt","vi":"buồn bực; làm phiền lòng; khó chịu","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Giải thích hiểu lầm văn hoá và xin lỗi","pattern":"I didn't realize (that)… · I didn't mean to… · Where I come from,… · In our culture,… · I should have asked. · I hope you can forgive me.","explain":"Nhận lỗi vì không biết: \"I didn't realize that…\". Nói rõ không cố ý: \"I didn't mean to upset anyone.\" So sánh văn hoá nhẹ nhàng: \"Where I come from, people…\", \"In our culture, …\". Nhận trách nhiệm: \"I should have asked.\" (lẽ ra tôi nên hỏi).","keys":["i didn't realize","i didn't mean to","where i come from","in our culture","i should have asked","forgive me"],"lines":[3,5,7,8,11,15]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-volunteer.mp3","v":"89c77b9fb5","duration":103.632,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}